#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| requires a valid license for provisioning new Instances, Apps and"
" Hosts, and converting existing Instances and Hosts to managed. Licenses can"
" be applied and updated in this section, and the current license status can "
"be checked."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| requiere a valid licencia para aprovisionamiento nuevo "
"Instancias, Apps y Hosts, y converting existente Instancias y Hosts a "
"gestionado. Licencias puede ser aplicado y updated en este sección, y el "
"actual licencia status puede ser checked."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:6
msgid ""
"|morpheus| is licensed for a certain number of concurrent workload elements "
"(WLEs) that may be managed or inventoried at any one time. See our "
"`Knowledge Base <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/What-is-a-"
"Workload-Element-or-WE-for-purposes-of-Morpheus-licensing?language=en_US>`_ "
"for specific information on the types of WLEs that count against |morpheus| "
"licensing."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| es licenciad para a cierto número de concurrent cargas de trabajo"
" elements (WLEs) ese puede be gestionado o inventoried en cualquier uno "
"time. See our `Knowledge Base "
"<https://soporte.morpheusdata.com/s/article/What-es-a-Workload-Element-o-WE-"
"para-purposes-de-Morpheus-licensing?language=en_US>`_ para específico "
"information en el tipos de WLEs ese count against |morpheus| licensing."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:9
msgid "Current License"
msgstr "Current Licencia"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:11
msgid ""
"If a License Key has already been applied, the License status is shown in "
"the `Current License` section:"
msgstr ""
"Si a Licencia Key tiene already been aplicado, el Licencia status es shown "
"en el `Current Licencia` sección:"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:13
msgid "Tenant Name"
msgstr "Inquilino Nombre"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:14
msgid "Company name the License was generated for."
msgstr "Company nombre el Licencia fue generated para."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:15
msgid "Start Date"
msgstr "Start Date"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:16
msgid "Date and time the current License started."
msgstr "Date y time el actual Licencia started."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:17
msgid "End Date"
msgstr "End Date"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:18
msgid "Date and time the current License expires."
msgstr "Date y time el actual Licencia expires."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:20
msgid "Space"
msgstr "Space"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:20
msgid "Amount of used and unused Managed RAM under the current License."
msgstr "Amount de usado y unused Gestionado RAM under el actual Licencia."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:22
msgid ""
"EXAMPLE: On a 1 TB License with 182 GB of RAM under management, the Space "
"section will show `Used Space 182.9GB  Unused Space 841.0GB`"
msgstr ""
"EXAMPLE: En a 1 TB Licencia con 182 GB de RAM under gestión, el Space "
"sección va a show `Usado Space 182.9GB Unused Space 841.0GB`"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:24
msgid ""
"Once a current License expires or has reached its Space limit, users will no"
" longer be able to provision new Instances, Apps, Hosts, or Bare Metal, or "
"convert existing Hosts, Virtual Machines, or Bare Metal to managed. Morpheus"
" will otherwise continue to function."
msgstr ""
"Once a actual Licencia expires o tiene reached su Space limit, usuarios va a"
" no longer be able a provision nuevo Instancias, Apps, Hosts, o Bare Metal, "
"o convert existente Hosts, Virtual Machines, o Bare Metal a gestionado. "
"Morpheus va a otherwise continue a function."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:27
msgid "Upgrade License Key"
msgstr "Upgrade Licencia Key"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:29
msgid "To add a new or update an existing License:"
msgstr "Un agregar a nuevo o update un existente Licencia:"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:31
msgid "Copy the License Key into the License Key field"
msgstr "Copy el Licencia Key en el Licencia Key campo"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:32
msgid "Click `UPDATE`"
msgstr "Click `UPDATE`"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:34
msgid "If valid, the new License will be applied."
msgstr "Si valid, el nuevo Licencia será aplicado."

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:37
msgid "Request new License"
msgstr "Request nuevo Licencia"

#: ../../administration/settings/license.rst:39
msgid ""
"Licenses can be requested at https://app.morpheushub.com, or by contacting "
"support@ or sales@ morpheusdata.com."
msgstr ""
"Licencias puede ser requested en https://app.morpheushub.com, o por "
"contacting soporte@ o sales@ morpheusdata.com."
